{"id":"6dbd30f084c7a7cd","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-reflection-truth-relation.md","title":"真理反思配合T-out推出局部反思","display":"lem-reflection-truth-relation — 真理反思配合T-out推出局部反思","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-reflection-truth-relation","aliases":["91-lem-reflection-truth-relation","91-lem-refl-truth-rel","91-lem-provability-truth"],"display":"lem-reflection-truth-relation — 真理反思配合T-out推出局部反思","depends_on":["[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","[[91-df-truth-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-reflection-truth-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-reflection-truth-relation</span><span>91-lem-refl-truth-rel</span><span>91-lem-provability-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-reflection-truth-relation — 真理反思配合T-out推出局部反思"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" href=\"?note=fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" title=\"91-df-reflection-principle\">91-df-reflection-principle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-reflection-truth-relation-—-真理反思配合-T-out-推出局部反思\">lem-reflection-truth-relation — 真理反思配合 T-out 推出局部反思</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> (含 PA 证明谓词与真理谓词的背景理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\)</span> (PA 的标准可证性谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (算术句子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}truth\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}truth\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明只是把\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\\)</span> 合成。</p>\n<p>每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的局部模式与对所有句法编码量化的单个“全局反思句”\n不同。要得到统一或全局版本，背景理论还必须能表示句法并统一证明\n相应 T-out，不能把元语言的“对每个公式”直接写成对象语言量词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-reflection-truth-relation-—-真理反思配合-T-out-推出局部反思","text":"lem-reflection-truth-relation — 真理反思配合 T-out 推出局部反思","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}truth\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1661,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-re